#: ../../getting_started/guides/autoinstall_instance.rst:123
msgid ""
"For our SuiteCRM application, we'll need to create an Apache config file."
" We can create a File Template in |morpheus| and the config file will be "
"generated dynamically at provision time with the appropriate values. "
"Navigate to |LibTemFil| and click :guilabel:`+ ADD`. Enter the following:"
msgstr "Para nossa aplicação SuiteCRM, precisaremos criar um arquivo de configuração do Apache. Podemos criar um File Template no |morpheus| e o arquivo de configuração será gerado dinamicamente no momento do provisionamento com os valores apropriados. Navegue até |LibTemFil| e clique em :guilabel:`+ ADD`. Informe o seguinte:"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/autoinstall_instance.rst:125
msgid "**NAME:** suitecrm - conf"
msgstr "**NAME:** suitecrm - conf"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/autoinstall_instance.rst:126
#: ../../getting_started/guides/autoinstall_instance.rst:170
#: ../../getting_started/guides/autoinstall_instance.rst:180
#: ../../getting_started/guides/autoinstall_instance.rst:284
#: ../../getting_started/guides/autoinstall_instance.rst:310
#: ../../getting_started/guides/autoinstall_instance.rst:329
#: ../../getting_started/guides/autoinstall_instance.rst:339
msgid "**LABELS:** SUITECRM"
msgstr "**LABELS:** SUITECRM"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/autoinstall_instance.rst:127
msgid "**FILE NAME:** suitecrm.conf"
msgstr "**FILE NAME:** suitecrm.conf"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/autoinstall_instance.rst:128
msgid "**FILE PATH:** /etc/apache2/sites-available"
msgstr "**FILE PATH:** /etc/apache2/sites-available"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/autoinstall_instance.rst:129
msgid "**PHASE:** Provision"
msgstr "**PHASE:** Provision"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/autoinstall_instance.rst:130
msgid ""
"**TEMPLATE:** See below for the complete template, note how we're able to"
" dynamically resolve |morpheus| variables within the template"
msgstr "**TEMPLATE:** Veja abaixo o template completo; observe como podemos resolver dinamicamente variáveis |morpheus| dentro do template"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/autoinstall_instance.rst:131
msgid "**FILE OWNER:** root"
msgstr "**FILE OWNER:** root"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/autoinstall_instance.rst:132
msgid "**SETTING NAME:** suitecrm"
msgstr "**SETTING NAME:** suitecrm"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/autoinstall_instance.rst:133
msgid "**SETTING CATEGORY:** App"
msgstr "**SETTING CATEGORY:** App"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/autoinstall_instance.rst:135
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<VirtualHost *:80>\n"
"   ServerAdmin admin@localhost\n"
"   ServerAlias \"<%=server.externalIp%>\"\n"
"   DocumentRoot /var/www/html/suitecrm\n"
"\n"
"   <Directory /var/www/html/suitecrm/>\n"
"        Options FollowSymlinks\n"
"        AllowOverride All\n"
"        Require all granted\n"
"   </Directory>\n"
"\n"
"   ErrorLog ${APACHE_LOG_DIR}/error.log\n"
"   CustomLog ${APACHE_LOG_DIR}/access.log combined\n"
"\n"
"   <Directory /var/www/html/suitecrm/>\n"
"          RewriteEngine on\n"
"          RewriteBase /\n"
"          RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-f\n"
"          RewriteRule ^(.*) index.php [PT,L]\n"
"  </Directory>\n"
"</VirtualHost>"
msgstr ""

